Site Fabric

Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs

Site Fabric is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for composing the
aggregate network state of one physical site from authoritative member-domain
publications, and for holding the site-level authority that fences who may
change it.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Site Fabric does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All state, logs and
evidence are written to local files chosen by the operator and never leave the
machine running the software.

Site Fabric accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on the
terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
